  "body": "## Constructive continuation of PR163\nExact base `9ea46052358ba3e190317347d7f0001bab23c398`. The prior 64-core NCP Rust stress/susceptibility kernel remains intact; this PR adds a **new standalone Python Einstein\u2013Vlasov initial-value/tangent system** for LRS Bianchi I, with isotropic radiation, source-normalized FD96 massive kinetic species and residual cold matter. It evolves `(b,s/H_ref,H_ref*t_elapsed)` plus analytic `d/dA` for the initial positive mass quadrupole `W=1+A P2`, `-1<=A<=2`.\n\n`kinetic_tangent.py`, `test_kinetic_tangent.py`, `export_rei_bridge.py`, `test_export_bridge.py`, `run_campaign.py` and `REI_HANDOFF.json` were **compared against the exact isolated Python files using their Git blob SHA-1**, not copied by guesswork. The source formula, not original file bytes, reconstructs immutable BASS `bianchi/matter/freestream.py` FD96/GL32; the source norm (m/T=30) matches `54.478197513209125`, source hash and locked AX03 cosmology pinned in handoff. No original BASS/REI owner file changed.\n\n## Derivation, experiments and corrections\n- Source stress energy, stable DeltaP and `chi=partial_b DeltaP` produce analytic `Z'=J_y Z+F_A` for the fully evolving (in this scoped model) Einstein LRS geometry.\n- Full matter energy-work identity `rho_x=-3(rho+pbar)-2(s/H)DeltaP` cancels shear forcing on differentiating the Hamiltonian; the independent Raychaudhuri equation checks a nontrivial physical relation instead of a tautological Hamiltonian subtraction.\n- **14/14 Python regressions PASS** in an isolated ChatGPT compute container, including source quadrature and positivity, signed shear and exact zero, analytic tangent/finite-difference trajectories, energy-work integral, step-accuracy and receiver schema.\n- Three masses m/T=3/30/300: tangent vs two separately solved perturbations maximum absolute endpoint error **2.98e-12, 3.38e-12, 4.83e-12** (dimensionless b,v,tau).\n- Actual 8\u00d7121 **968-row** proposed `BackgroundPoint`-like source table, `SHA256 5a7844834b50fbc046995678a6aaf936252a81e49de1593604eee30641274133`, independent finite-difference Raychaudhuri relative max **5.24e-11**.\n- Critical recovered physical distinction: exactly isotropic **massive kinetic** distribution is not original all-cold-dust `Omega_m` FRW. At f_m=.1, final H differences from original frozen cold FLRW are -1.51685%/-0.0327593%/-0.000332725% for m/T=3/30/300; **f_m=0** returns exact original FLRW. The initial inappropriate cold-FLRW-equality test failed and was repaired as an assumption error, without widening acceptance.\n- Wolfram kernel algebraic identities four exact zero; native xAct not re-run in this turn.\n\n## Execution limit / source firewall\nAt the start of this turn the connected Desktop Commander reported **monthly usage exhausted**, explicitly prohibiting retries. Consequently there was **NO fresh execution on user's local Ubuntu or 64c NCP**, no new native Rust build or original rei_microphysics H/He driver validation. This step's Python calculations and tests ran in the ChatGPT sandbox; earlier PR163 NCP evidence is historical, separately cited. The sender's `s/H` is signed; `Sigma=sqrt(3)|s|/H` is nonnegative and must not be used as signed geometry input. PR150/152 and sibling BASS_HE66/bass_cr72 remain separate source authorities; no auto-adoption or old AX08 checkpoint resume.\n\n## Backup and provenance\nFull standalone source, tests (including failed assumption and repaired test receipts), 11-case campaign JSON, complete 968-row CSV, theory report and handoff packaged as `BASS_PR164_Einstein_Vlasov_Tangent_20261016.zip` with internal SHA manifest. Independently downloaded **Library and Google Drive** backups (user-owned `/BASS/...` and `/Google Drive/BASS_BACKUPS/...`) both agree byte-for-byte with original `SHA256 81412cc6f4b72011d153f4520177f3e433f0c190a44aac37f9ca736f5c694f9b`. `PUBLIC_RESULTS.json` summarizes the actual numerical evidence.\n\n**Claim:** derived / Python-implementation-verified / numerically checked **only** for massive kinetic Einstein LRS + isotropic radiation and a proposed geometry-table handoff. Not yet native type-checked or scientifically admitted EoR. Do not auto-merge. Next action is owner-approved feature-gated native intake with fresh source/checkpoint and same-clock photo/thermal/4-momentum ledgers.",
